        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Strait\n- Products: “I Gotta Get to You”, “Twang”\n- Topics: music releases, biography\n\nFacts:\n- George Strait was born on May 18, 1952.\n- George Strait is an American country music singer, songwriter, actor, and music producer.\n- \"I Gotta Get to You\" was released in February 2010.\n- \"I Gotta Get to You\" was the 90th single of George Strait's career.\n- \"I Gotta Get to You\" was the third single from George Strait's album \"Twang\".",
